<title>INDIA: India's CARE retains the rating of ALFL.</title>
<headline>India's CARE retains the rating of ALFL.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Analysis &amp; Research Ltd (CARE) said on Thursday it retained the rating of CARE A (FD) Singal A for the on-going Fixed Deposit programme of Alta Leasing and Finance Limited (ALFL) for an enhanced limit of 100 million rupees.</p>
<p>During FY97, ALFL continued its thrust on fund-based activities with more than 90 percent of total income being earned through these activities.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
